&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape a brighter financial future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with our members, we’re changing the way people think about and interact with personal finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a next-generation financial services company and national bank using innovative, mobile-first technology to help our millions of members reach their goals. The industry is going through an unprecedented transformation, and we’re at the forefront. We’re proud to come to work every day knowing that what we do has a direct impact on people’s lives, with our core values guiding us every step of the way. &lt;strong&gt;Join us to invest in yourself, your career, and the financial world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;SoFi&#39;s AI Platform team builds the foundation that enables every engineer at SoFi to ship faster, safer, and with higher leverage from AI. Our AI Developer Experience (AI DevEx) team owns SoFi&#39;s interactive coding strategy and underlying infrastructure: AI economics, coding harnesses and harness vending, our evaluation platform, the enterprise AI Gateway, and intelligent model routing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;32,0&quot;&gt;As a founding Staff Software Engineer, you&#39;ll be a technical leader on the team: owning major platform systems, setting the team&#39;s engineering standards, and working closely with our Autonomous Coding, CI/CD, and Code Factory teams and the engineering teams we serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e6eae2957f98c1bb-28&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;34,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Own platform systems end-to-end: design, build, and operate foundational components of the AI Gateway, model routing, eval platform, and harness vending, transforming broadly defined challenges into production-grade systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34,1,0&quot;&gt;Instrument AI economics: develop usage telemetry, cost allocation, and chargeback mechanisms that provide transparent visibility into AI spend per developer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e6eae2957f98c1bb-29&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;34,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead team execution: plan feature architecture and implementation paths, parallelize work streams across teammates, and align cross-team dependencies with product and engineering leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e6eae2957f98c1bb-30&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;34,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Guide technical design: facilitate design reviews, evaluate architectural trade-offs, and align critical technical outcomes with the broader SoFi engineering community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e6eae2957f98c1bb-31&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;34,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Establish technical standards: define coding conventions, automated patterns, and architectural standards that result in maintainable, extensible software for other engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_e6eae2957f98c1bb-32&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;34,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive operational excellence: automate build, test, and deployment workflows; serve as a leading resolver on production incidents; and resolve root causes through post-incident actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;34,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34,6,0&quot;&gt;Maintain a 6-to-12-month technical vision: anticipate system growth, prioritize architectural hygiene, and make pragmatic build-versus-adopt choices across an evolving tooling ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34,7,0&quot;&gt;Partner with internal engineering teams: engage directly with developers as primary customers to understand their workflows, drive adoption of interactive coding tools, and translate feedback into continuous system enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;
